  "configuration_id": "config_048",
  "reason": "The strongest evidence points to scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + multiprofile as the dominant architecture (config_031: 0.7250, config_019: 0.7062). Within this family, transformer aggregation + weighted fusion (config_031) is the current best. The only untested variant of this exact architecture is config_048 (scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, multiprofile, transformer, concat), which isolates the fusion method as the sole variable. Weighted has beaten concat in every prior comparison (0.525 vs 0.512, 0.706 vs untested), so config_048 is unlikely to surpass config_031, but testing it completes the 2×2 aggregation×fusion grid for the best architecture and confirms whether weighted fusion's edge holds with transformer aggregation. This is the highest-value exploitation step: it either yields a small improvement or definitively closes the search on this family, freeing the final experiment for a targeted exploration. Expected cost is similar to config_031 (~3.5–4 GPU hours) since it uses the same transformer aggregation, multiprofile processing, and multimodal pipeline—only the fusion operation changes."
}

